    "VISUAL_NAME": "Grid",
    "SCHEMA_NAME": "FAM_WARRANTY_AMC_EXPIRY",
    "SCHEMA_DESCR": "Warranty / AMC Expiry Grid — warranty (FAM_WARRANTY_DETAILS) and AMC contract coverage (FAM_AMC_CONTRACTS + FAM_AMC_CONTRACT_LINE) unioned per asset, with days-to-expiry. Branch/Location filters resolve the asset's current site from its latest APPROVED FAM_ASSET_TRANSFER (FAM_ASSET_REGISTER itself carries no branch/location column). Assumption: warranty rows have no native STATUS, so STATUS is derived ACTIVE/EXPIRED from WARRANTY_END_DATE vs today; AMC rows use the contract's real STATUS. Assumption: ASSET_NAME is sourced from the latest FAM_ASSET_TRANSFER/FAM_ASSET_DISPOSAL record for the asset, not FAM_ASSET_REGISTER.ASSET_NAME directly — FAM_ASSET_REGISTER is present in the project's Database Design (3 columns: ASSET_CODE, ASSET_NAME, CAPITALIZATION_DATE) but is not yet deployed as a physical table in this preview database; once the Asset Register transaction is deployed, this SELECT can be simplified back to a direct JOIN on FAM_ASSET_REGISTER for full name coverage (today ASSET_NAME is blank for assets with no transfer/disposal history). Assumption: ASSET_CODE drill-down to Asset Register detail must be wired as a Dashboard tile binding (VISUAL_PARAM=ASSET_CODE) when this visual is placed on a dashboard — a standalone Visual JSON has no drill-target field.",
    "SCHEMA_TYPE": "S",
    "OUTPUT_TYPE": "JSON",
    "DATABASE_TYPE": "1",
    "DATABASE_DETAIL": { "DATABASE_NAME": "PostgreSQL", "TYPE": 1 }
  },
